  "part": {
    "name": "Rounded-rectangle frame ring with stepped rims",
    "description": "Single-solid rectangular frame/ring with rounded corners and a two-level rim/ledge on both top and bottom edges. Features visible include: (1) large opposite side faces (front/back) with inner cutout, (2) outer perimeter walls (left/right straight walls plus corner rounds), (3) inner perimeter walls defining the opening, (4) top and bottom rim/step planes, (5) large-radius edge rounds (R10 class) and small edge fillets (R2 class) plus corner torus blends.",
    "source_views": [
      "front",
      "back",
      "left",
      "right",
      "top",
      "bottom",
      "toprightiso"
    ],
    "symmetry_note": "Approx. 2-axis symmetry about the part center (left-right and top-bottom in the rectangular plane), with repeated geometry at four corners; STEP normals indicate the model is globally rotated ~15° about an axis, but the part itself is symmetric."
  },
